          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2c3600b2a110",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "6ec3f88272e2",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Un terroir à la croisée des influences"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "28c990fd1832",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "ef1c5b87d668",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Les sols de Villenauxe-la-Grande se distinguent par une "
            },
            {
              "_key": "36c0a9ecadba",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "argilo-calcaires mêlés à des marnes"
            },
            {
              "_key": "9a6397c44b1f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", offrant aux cépages plantés une diversité d’expression rare dans l’Aube. Ce terroir, plus tempéré grâce à sa position géographique, permet une maturation progressive des raisins, tout en conservant une belle fraîcheur aromatique."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "35ed0e212af5",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "06f3311ebcb2",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Un vignoble confidentiel et engagé"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7d6f44dcbaa2",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "8e710d16d49f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "À la frontière entre la Champagne et la Brie, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "34ba9760dad5",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Villenauxe-la-Grande"
            },
            {
              "_key": "1d7d83512102",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " occupe une place singulière dans le paysage viticole champenois. Isolée des grands ensembles que sont "
            },
            {
              "_key": "d0cff4ece22d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "79c9ab83c718"
              ],
              "text": "la Côte des Bar"
            },
            {
              "_key": "f4af944545cc",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " ou "
            },
            {
              "_key": "98aa2366d463",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "dfcb6a53a83a"
              ],
              "text": "Montgueux"
            },
            {
              "_key": "bcf78c8e1bdd",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", cette zone viticole forme un "
            },
            {
              "_key": "71068397b180",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "îlot de vignes à la personnalité affirmée"
            },
